{"unit_id":"m1khal3v__dsh-llm-key-rotation#feature-1","repo":"m1khal3v/dsh-llm-key-rotation","commit":"bf5fb3f327fa60bc839d3ad9faad67a9a3b501a7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH LLM Key Rotation 的功能「失败后轮换密钥」：提供商请求出现配置的失败码时，插件把密钥链中的下一项写入该提供商的凭据引用并返回 retry，让 agent 回合重新尝试。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:224-289"]}
